         "type": "string",
         "description": "Topic identifier. `all` is a wildcard alias for every stream (order-book\nexcluded). Order-book depth uses parameterized topics of the form\n`orderbook.{venue}.{pair}` (e.g. `orderbook.hyperliquid-spot.HYPE-USDC`,\n`orderbook.hyperliquid-perp.BTC-USD`); these are subscribable but not part\nof the fixed enum below and are never delivered to `all` subscribers.\n",
